{
 "component": "RankedList",
 "version": 1,
 "summary": "A leaderboard of a few rows (top products, longest runs, busiest stations): each row a rank badge, a name, its value with a unit at the end and a share bar of value / the largest value, read by a screen reader as one item per row: \"Number 1, Espresso beans, 412 units\".",
 "params": {
  "names": {
   "type": "list",
   "required": true,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "One name per row in rank order, e.g. [\"Espresso beans\", \"Oat milk\", \"Croissants\"]; fixed when the document is built (3 to 10 rows). An entry may be \"@name\" of a root-level string variable the host sets"
  },
  "values": {
   "type": "float",
   "required": true,
   "doc": "A float array, \"@name\" of resources.floatArrays (export it so the host can update it), one value per name in the same order, highest first: the bars are each value over the largest"
  },
  "unit": {
   "type": "string",
   "default": "",
   "doc": "After every value, as written: \" units\", \" km\", \" €\" (spoken too)"
  },
  "decimals": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 0,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Digits after the point in the values"
  },
  "color": {
   "type": "color",
   "default": "@colors.primary",
   "doc": "The bars and the first rank's disc"
  },
  "showBars": {
   "type": "bool",
   "default": true,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "false drops the share bars: a compact 32 dp list"
  }
 },
 "locals": {
  "mx": "max(arrayMax(@values), 0.0001)",
  "h": {
   "$if": "showBars",
   "then": 48,
   "else": 32
  },
  "ty": {
   "$if": "showBars",
   "then": 17,
   "else": 16
  }
 },
 "capabilities": [
  "data.array",
  "text.dynamic",
  "a11y.labels",
  "draw.shapes",
  "draw.clip"
 ],
 "call": {
  "RankedList": {
   "names": [
    "Espresso beans",
    "Oat milk",
    "Croissants"
   ],
   "values": "@sales",
   "unit": " units"
  }
 },
 "pitfalls": [
  "One canvas per row, with its own semantics (\"Number N, name, value unit\" from textMerge): the rank, the name and the value are drawn, not layout texts, so a screen reader stops once per row instead of three times. The JSON semantics has no merge mode",
  "names is a JSON list written into the document ($each); values is the name of a float array (\"@sales\" in resources.floatArrays), read with arrayGet(values, i): a host can change the numbers (and the names, through string variables) but not the number of rows. Give one value per name, sorted, highest first: the list does not sort",
  "The bar is (width − 36) × value / max(arrayMax(values), 0.0001), at least 6 dp so a tiny share still shows; the track is the full width (mono: a 1 dp outline instead of a track fill)",
  "A long name shrinks to 80 % to fit before the value and is then clipped (drawn text has no ellipsis); the value never shrinks. Numbers are grouped by thousands (textFromFloat flags 23)",
  "The rank is textFromFloat(i + 1), a constant per row; rank 1 is a filled disc in `color`, the others a ring, so the leader stands out in mono too",
  "It fills its parent's width, 48 dp per row (32 without bars): in a row, give it a weighted box",
  "Each row measures its own name and value (per-row names nw_@i, vw_@i...): a long name shrinks only its own row"
 ],
 "body": {
  "column": {
   "modifiers": [
    "fillMaxWidth"
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "$each": "names",
     "as": "nm",
     "index": "i",
     "do": {
      "canvas": {
       "modifiers": [
        "fillMaxWidth",
        {
         "height": "@h"
        },
        {
         "semantics": {
          "contentDescription": {
           "type": "textMerge",
           "id1": {
            "type": "textMerge",
            "id1": {
             "type": "textMerge",
             "id1": "Number ",
             "id2": {
              "type": "textFromFloat",
              "value": "@i + 1",
              "whole": 2,
              "decimal": 0,
              "flags": 5
             }
            },
            "id2": {
             "type": "textMerge",
             "id1": ", ",
             "id2": "@nm"
            }
           },
           "id2": {
            "type": "textMerge",
            "id1": ", ",
            "id2": {
             "$if": "unit",
             "then": {
              "type": "textMerge",
              "id1": {
               "type": "textFromFloat",
               "value": "arrayGet(@values, @i)",
               "whole": 9,
               "decimal": "@decimals",
               "flags": 23
              },
              "id2": "@unit"
             },
             "else": {
              "type": "textFromFloat",
              "value": "arrayGet(@values, @i)",
              "whole": 9,
              "decimal": "@decimals",
              "flags": 23
             }
            }
           }
          }
         }
        }
       ],
       "commands": [
        {
         "$if": "i == '0'",
         "then": [
          {
           "paint": {
            "ops": [
             {
              "color": "@color"
             },
             {
              "style": "fill"
             },
             {
              "alpha": 1
             }
            ]
           }
          },
          {
           "drawCircle": {
            "cx": 12,
            "cy": "@h / 2",
            "radius": 12
           }
          },
          {
           "paint": {
            "ops": [
             {
              "color": "@colors.onPrimary"
             },
             {
              "textSize": "@theme.text_sm"
             }
            ]
           }
          }
         ],
         "else": [
          {
           "paint": {
            "ops": [
             {
              "color": "@colors.muted"
             },
             {
              "style": "stroke"
             },
             {
              "strokeWidth": {
               "$if": "theme.mono",
               "then": 1.5,
               "else": 2
              }
             },
             {
              "alpha": 1
             }
            ]
           }
          },
          {
           "drawCircle": {
            "cx": 12,
            "cy": "@h / 2",
            "radius": 11
           }
          },
          {
           "paint": {
            "ops": [
             {
              "color": "@colors.onSurface"
             },
             {
              "style": "fill"
             },
             {
              "textSize": "@theme.text_sm"
             }
            ]
           }
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "drawTextAnchored": {
          "text": {
           "type": "textFromFloat",
           "value": "@i + 1",
           "whole": 2,
           "decimal": 0,
           "flags": 5
          },
          "x": 12,
          "y": "@h / 2",
          "panX": 0,
          "panY": 0
         }
        },
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "style": "fill"
           },
           {
            "color": "@colors.onSurface"
           },
           {
            "textSize": "@theme.text_md"
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "textMeasure": {
          "text": {
           "$if": "unit",
           "then": {
            "type": "textMerge",
            "id1": {
             "type": "textFromFloat",
             "value": "arrayGet(@values, @i)",
             "whole": 9,
             "decimal": "@decimals",
             "flags": 23
            },
            "id2": "@unit"
           },
           "else": {
            "type": "textFromFloat",
            "value": "arrayGet(@values, @i)",
            "whole": 9,
            "decimal": "@decimals",
            "flags": 23
           }
          },
          "mode": 0,
          "name": "vw_@i"
         }
        },
        {
         "drawTextAnchored": {
          "text": {
           "$if": "unit",
           "then": {
            "type": "textMerge",
            "id1": {
             "type": "textFromFloat",
             "value": "arrayGet(@values, @i)",
             "whole": 9,
             "decimal": "@decimals",
             "flags": 23
            },
            "id2": "@unit"
           },
           "else": {
            "type": "textFromFloat",
            "value": "arrayGet(@values, @i)",
            "whole": 9,
            "decimal": "@decimals",
            "flags": 23
           }
          },
          "x": "componentWidth()",
          "y": "@ty",
          "panX": 1,
          "panY": 0
         }
        },
        {
         "textMeasure": {
          "text": "@nm",
          "mode": 0,
          "name": "nw_@i"
         }
        },
        {
         "variable": {
          "name": "room_@i",
          "value": "max(1, componentWidth() - 36 - @vw_@i - 12)"
         }
        },
        {
         "variable": {
          "name": "ns_@i",
          "value": "clamp(0.8, 1, @room_@i / @nw_@i)"
         }
        },
        {
         "save": [
          {
           "clipRect": {
            "left": "36",
            "top": 0,
            "right": "36 + @room_@i",
            "bottom": "@h"
           }
          },
          {
           "scale": {
            "sx": "@ns_@i",
            "sy": "@ns_@i",
            "pivotX": "36",
            "pivotY": "@ty"
           }
          },
          {
           "drawTextAnchored": {
            "text": "@nm",
            "x": "36",
            "y": "@ty",
            "panX": -1,
            "panY": 0
           }
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "$if": "showBars",
         "then": [
          {
           "paint": {
            "ops": {
             "$if": "theme.mono",
             "then": [
              {
               "color": "@colors.outline"
              },
              {
               "style": "stroke"
              },
              {
               "strokeWidth": 1
              }
             ],
             "else": [
              {
               "color": "@colors.track"
              },
              {
               "style": "fill"
              }
             ]
            }
           }
          },
          {
           "drawRoundRect": {
            "left": "36",
            "top": 35,
            "right": "componentWidth()",
            "bottom": 41,
            "rx": 3,
            "ry": 3
           }
          },
          {
           "paint": {
            "ops": [
             {
              "color": "@color"
             },
             {
              "style": "fill"
             }
            ]
           }
          },
          {
           "drawRoundRect": {
            "left": "36",
            "top": 35,
            "right": "36 + max(6, (componentWidth() - 36) * arrayGet(@values, @i) / @mx)",
            "bottom": 41,
            "rx": 3,
            "ry": 3
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}
